# Test Case: TC-AUTH-002
## Title: Invalid password
**Scenario ID:** TS-AUTH-002

**Priority:** High

**Type:** Functional, Negative

**Automation:** Yes

**Author:** Marcin Lamberski

**Created:** 2025-12-31

**Status:** Approved

## Objective:
Verify that user can't successfully login, because password was incorrect

## Preconditions:
- User account exists 
- User is on login page
- User is not currently logged in

## Test Data:
| Field    | Value              |
|----------|-------------------|
| Login   | standard_user |
| Password | Test123!         |

## Test Steps:
| Step | Action | Expected Result |
|------|--------|----------------|
| 1 | Navigate to https://www.saucedemo.com/ | Login page displays |
| 2 | Enter Login: standard_user | Login appears in field |
| 3 | Enter password: Test123!  | Password masked with bullets |
| 4 | Click "Login" button | User should get message "Epic sadface: Username and password do not match any user in this service"|

## Expected Result:
- User unsuccessfully authenticated

## Status:
Pass 
